  "description": "Optional ASP.NET Core authentication for Elarion apps behind an authenticating reverse proxy (Cloudflare Access, Google IAP, oauth2-proxy, any OIDC gateway): AddElarionProxyIdentity validates the token the proxy forwards in a header or cookie with JwtBearer (issuer, audience, signing keys from a JWKS URL or OIDC discovery through IdentityModel's ConfigurationManager), refuses to start unauthenticated outside Development, maps ICurrentUser, provides a Development stand-in identity with a user switch, and reads an ExternalIdentity record.",
